{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What if your significant other is in danger, but you have to deal with an urgent call of nature on the way to the rescue? \u201cGo Groundshel!\u201d is a \u201cSuper Maria\u201d puzzle adventure game in which a groundhog girl endeavors to save her male partner from the villain. Awkwardly stepping out of her comfort zone, she becomes a heroine who confronts enemies despite lacking combat training. However, before locating her partner, she needs to solve a personal issue: finding a usable toilet!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE A CHILDREN\u2019S BOOK-STYLE WORLD</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first journey may be dangerous\u2026 but it\u2019s thrillingly so.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into each level as the story unfolds, and revisit your adventure through a beautifully illustrated journal that captures every dramatic and delightful moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069370/extras/4dabc184efffe025c1528be0e04de3f6.avif?t=1773086355\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ADVENTURE &amp; RESCUE THE PRINCE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather clues, follow the trail of the kidnapped \u201cprince,\u201d and confront the villain who took him. Your mission: bring him home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069370/extras/9cb9ff93ecc017f07f065ef54e5db910.avif?t=1773086355\" width=1560 height=874 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHOICE-DRIVEN BATTLES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our s/hero has never set foot on an adventure before. She faces enemies using pure instinct\u2014either clawing her way through danger or leaning into kindness to befriend unexpected creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069370/extras/18c0e3d8ed9c4c08739f9f3cac41c961.avif?t=1773086355\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SOLVE STRANGE &amp; QUIRKY PUZZLES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even heroes have bodily needs. Each level contains one or two wonderfully odd puzzles centered around finding a usable toilet. Chase destiny\u2026 but don\u2019t forget nature calls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069370/extras/ae6408c8c28b8716f60cfbee9368fefd.avif?t=1773086355\" width=1560 height=874 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf A female protagonist on a transformative growth journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf A \u201cSuper Maria\u201d narrative: the girl rescues the guy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Delightfully bizarre toilet-themed puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Choice-based encounters: battle enemies with scratch attacks or befriend them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Themed maps filled with secrets, hidden objects, and surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf A narrative journal documenting key events, characters, and items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Multiple whimsical and heartfelt endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf A comforting, atmospheric, and occasionally spooky soundtrack by an internationally acclaimed composer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Hand-crafted illustrations and animations by a deeply dedicated art team.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3069370?t=1773086355","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3069370?t=1773086355","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069370/af7a3abb2cc408ca6d5f285f4add4110a2929517/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773086355","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069370/af7a3abb2cc408ca6d5f285f4add4110a2929517/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773086355","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3843750,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What if your significant other is in danger, but you have to deal with an urgent call of nature on the way to the rescue? \u201cGo Groundshel!\u201d is a \u201cSuper Maria\u201d puzzle adventure game in which a groundhog girl endeavors to save her male partner from the villain. Awkwardly stepping out of her comfort zone, she becomes a heroine who confronts enemies despite lacking combat training. However, before locating her partner, she needs to solve a personal issue: finding a usable toilet!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE A CHILDREN\u2019S BOOK-STYLE WORLD</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first journey may be dangerous\u2026 but it\u2019s thrillingly so.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into each level as the story unfolds, and revisit your adventure through a beautifully illustrated journal that captures every dramatic and delightful moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069370/extras/4dabc184efffe025c1528be0e04de3f6.avif?t=1773086355\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ADVENTURE &amp; RESCUE THE PRINCE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather clues, follow the trail of the kidnapped \u201cprince,\u201d and confront the villain who took him. Your mission: bring him home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069370/extras/9cb9ff93ecc017f07f065ef54e5db910.avif?t=1773086355\" width=1560 height=874 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHOICE-DRIVEN BATTLES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our s/hero has never set foot on an adventure before. She faces enemies using pure instinct\u2014either clawing her way through danger or leaning into kindness to befriend unexpected creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069370/extras/18c0e3d8ed9c4c08739f9f3cac41c961.avif?t=1773086355\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SOLVE STRANGE &amp; QUIRKY PUZZLES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even heroes have bodily needs. Each level contains one or two wonderfully odd puzzles centered around finding a usable toilet. Chase destiny\u2026 but don\u2019t forget nature calls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069370/extras/ae6408c8c28b8716f60cfbee9368fefd.avif?t=1773086355\" width=1560 height=874 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf A female protagonist on a transformative growth journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf A \u201cSuper Maria\u201d narrative: the girl rescues the guy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Delightfully bizarre toilet-themed puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Choice-based encounters: battle enemies with scratch attacks or befriend them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Themed maps filled with secrets, hidden objects, and surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf A narrative journal documenting key events, characters, and items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Multiple whimsical and heartfelt endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf A comforting, atmospheric, and occasionally spooky soundtrack by an internationally acclaimed composer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf Hand-crafted illustrations and animations by a deeply dedicated art team.</p>","developers":["Curaxuan"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3069370/d461fc408e213af99d387d1ac8156a09e3b5695e/header.jpg?t=1773086355","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OSX 10.10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 256 mb video memory, OpenGL 2<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3069370/513070452/cb112b02d9f0868fff2f01a5b8ae64d772762e30/1772920717/dash_av1.mpd?t=1772922107","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3069370/513070452/cb112b02d9f0868fff2f01a5b8ae64d772762e30/1772920717/dash_h264.mpd?t=1772922107","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3069370/513070452/cb112b02d9f0868fff2f01a5b8ae64d772762e30/1772920717/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1772922107","id":257299577,"name":"Teaser2026","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps